<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":! stdin_handle = $'std::io::Stdin'\n\n:! stdin_error = $'std::io::Error'\n\n:= read_to_end () : string =\n    backend_switch {\n        Rust = \\ () =>\n            := handle = $'std::io::stdin()' : stdin_handle\n            := read = $'std::io::read_to_string(!handle)' : resultm::result' sm'::std_string stdin_error\n            read |> resultm::unwrap_or' (sm'::to_std_string \"\") |> sm'::from_std_string\n        Fsharp = \\ () => $'System.Console.In.ReadToEnd ()' : string\n        Python = \\ () =>\n            global \"import sys\"\n            $'sys.stdin.read()' : string\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :! stdin_handle = $'std::io::Stdin'

  :! stdin_error = $'std::io::Error'

  := read_to_end () : string =
      backend_switch {
          Rust = \ () =>
              := handle = $'std::io::stdin()' : stdin_handle
              := read = $'std::io::read_to_string(!handle)' : resultm::result' sm'::std_string stdin_error
              read |> resultm::unwrap_or' (sm'::to_std_string "") |> sm'::from_std_string
          Fsharp = \ () => $'System.Console.In.ReadToEnd ()' : string
          Python = \ () =>
              global "import sys"
              $'sys.stdin.read()' : string
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

